01:1207 6559            	   351:   ADC PARAM
01:1209 0A              	   352:   ASL
01:120A 8559            	   353:   STA PARAM
01:120C 68              	   354:   PLA
01:120D 6559            	   355:   ADC PARAM
01:120F 8559            	   356:   STA PARAM
01:1211 60              	   357:   RTS
